{{!-- Default values — shown when Ghost editor for "values" page is empty --}}
<div class="values-list">
  <div class="value-item">
    <h3 class="value-title"><span class="vn">01</span>Clarity over cleverness</h3>
    <p class="value-desc">Good writing and good marketing both come down to saying something clearly. Jargon is often a mask for fuzzy thinking. I'd rather be understood than impressive.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="value-item">
    <h3 class="value-title"><span class="vn">02</span>Stories are the most powerful thing humans make</h3>
    <p class="value-desc">Every great brand, every movement, every relationship — at the core, it's a story. I think deeply about narrative and try to use it responsibly.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="value-item">
    <h3 class="value-title"><span class="vn">03</span>Curiosity is a discipline, not a personality trait</h3>
    <p class="value-desc">Being curious doesn't just happen — it takes deliberate effort. Reading widely, asking the dumb question, staying a student. That's the work.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="value-item">
    <h3 class="value-title"><span class="vn">04</span>Give more than you take</h3>
    <p class="value-desc">In work, in relationships, in online spaces — when you orient yourself toward contributing rather than extracting, things tend to work out. This compounds.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="value-item">
    <h3 class="value-title"><span class="vn">05</span>Most problems are communication problems</h3>
    <p class="value-desc">Bad marketing, broken teams, failing products — dig deep enough and you usually find a gap between what someone meant and what someone heard. Words matter.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="value-item">
    <h3 class="value-title"><span class="vn">06</span>Slow down to speed up</h3>
    <p class="value-desc">The instinct is always to move faster. But thinking things through properly, reading slowly, sleeping before you send — that's where quality lives.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="value-item">
    <h3 class="value-title"><span class="vn">07</span>Strong opinions, loosely held</h3>
    <p class="value-desc">I try not to have hot takes. Most things are complicated. The more I learn about anything, the more I see nuance. Context is everything.</p>
  </div>
</div>
